  "sections": {
    "review": {
      "summary": "Read the owner's audit (AUD-01..AUD-07) and AUDIT_REMEDIATION_AND_COMPLETION_REQUIREMENTS.md. Confirmed AUD-01: walkforward.walk builds targets from completed observation rows (prepare keeps valid rows), so it cannot forecast an unplayed week; PROSPECTIVE_2026.md planned post-season reconstruction. Week 12's preweek cutoff is 2026-11-26 01:00 UTC (GB at LA, Wednesday), per nflverse's schedule and frozen.json. Data state: the canonical targets index 6ffb62fb holds 2026 only through week 9; nflverse holds 2026 through week 11 (observed 2026-11-24 22:57 UTC); the league's current snapshot has 8 FFA teams holding 13 D/STs. walk() needs every earlier week's point-in-time B00 for residuals, so a week-W forecast walks weeks 1..W. evaluation_join requires 1:1 labels, so missing labels need their own join. CI on main was red after the owner moved the specification into docs/research/dvp (four broken links, the audit script and test path, and a completed task's review file).",
